.subckt amp_033_ti_ldo_ref_selfbias vdd vout vinp vinn vss
CC ncz vout 'c_comp'
RZ nb ncz 'r_z'
XM1 na vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=x_dut_xm1_l w=x_dut_xm1_w
XM2 nb vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=x_dut_xm2_l w=x_dut_xm2_w
XM3 na na vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=x_dut_xm3_l w=x_dut_xm3_w
